> * Anyway, you want ... (unnecessary) precise studies....


No, what I want is studies, period. At this point, there have been no case
studies regarding the relative likelihood of miscomprehension between
utterances in Lojban and Natlang-X, which means there is absolutely no
evidence one way or another about the subject. As I said before, this isn't
philosophy. Without evidence, there can be no conclusions, only claims and
arguments.

